EchoGesture submission NOTICE
================================

This NOTICE ships with the EchoGesture Track 2 submission bundle and
with the v8_privacy patch tree (``evaluation/device/v8_privacy/``).
It records licence and attribution provenance as it stands at audit
time. It does NOT grant, claim, or upgrade any redistribution right.
Where a right is unresolved, this file says so explicitly — do not
treat inclusion of a binary and this note as a licence grant.

Reading guide: §1 covers repo-authored code (MIT). §2 covers model
assets under ``models/`` — the only place redistribution risk lives.
§3 covers datasets and derived data. §4 covers Python dependencies.
§5 lists assertions this project deliberately does NOT make.

