3. Datasets and derived data — non-redistributable
------------------------------------------------------------------------
* WLASL — C-UDA licence (academic / non-commercial). Clips cannot be
  redistributed or shipped commercially. Keep clips, splits, and any
  landmark caches outside Git and outside the submission ZIP.
* ASL Citizen (Microsoft Research licence, non-commercial, no
  redistribution). Clips, per-participant result rows
  (``evaluation/asl_citizen_predictions.csv`` — `participant` IDs
  ``P15``-style — personal-adjacent metadata), and trained weights carry
  the research-only context. Public exports strip participant IDs
  (see ``v8_privacy/sanitize_evidence.py``); the salt file for any
  pseudonymisation must never ship.
* Neither dataset ships with this NOTICE, and no clip, split, or cache
  derived from them is licensed by inclusion. ``fetch_*.py`` helpers
  write only to operator-chosen output directories outside the repo —
  keep that behaviour; any validation manifest containing private clip
  paths likewise stays outside Git and outside the ZIP.

